define user ask off topic
  "What's the weather like today?"
  "What do you think about politics?"
  "Tell me a joke about my coworkers"
  "Who do you think will win the cricket match?"
  "Write me a poem about the ocean"

define bot refuse off topic
  "I'm scoped to CloudSync support only, so I can't help with that here - happy to help with a sharing, storage, sync, or account question instead."

define flow off topic guard
  user ask off topic
  bot refuse off topic